<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>PAT-HOT · T激光</title><link>https://sun-zihang.github.io/pat-hot/#/all</link><description>激光</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:21:56 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Ultrashort laser pulses offer a new way to probe electrons' quantum geometry</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ultrashort-laser-pulses-probe-electrons.html</link><description>Researchers at Friedrich Schiller University Jena and the University of Regensburg have developed a method for determining, using light, a quantum property of electrons that has hitherto been difficult to access. The focus is on what is known as Berry curvature—a quantity that describes certain geometric properties of the quantum mechanical states of electrons. The researchers measured it in a layer of the semiconductor tungsten diselenide, just one atomic layer thick, using ultrashort laser pul</description><guid isPermaLink="false">7702fee1ff8f</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:21:56 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>‘Cooked’ fiber doubles range of ultralow-noise supercontinuum lasers</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55408688/cooked-fiber-doubles-range-of-ultralow-noise-supercontinuum-lasers</link><description>After heating an optical fiber for nearly an hour, researchers completely changed its dispersion within a small section and ended up with a supercontinuum that covers a wide range of wavelengths—0.86 to 2.90 µm—and it’s also remarkably stable and reliable.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">8c5f75047f13</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:21:56 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Ultraviolet laser pulses engineer diamond defects selectively, leaving quantum qubits intact</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ultraviolet-laser-pulses-diamond-defects.html</link><description>When we think about a diamond, we often think about a material whose value comes from its perfection. In my research, however, I am interested in something almost opposite: the tiny imperfections inside diamonds. These atomic-scale defects can give diamonds new optical and electronic properties, and some of them can serve as quantum systems. The challenge is learning how to control these defects without disturbing the others.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e1f4243c1ce7</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:21:56 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>频准激光上半年营收2.56亿元增42.13% 净利润增24.58%</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/123/a1316461.html</link><description>C114讯 8月27日消息（颜翊）昨日，本月18日刚刚上市的量子科技公司频准激光披露首份半年度业绩报告，2026年上半年，公司实现营业收入2.56亿元，同比增长42.13%；实现归母净利润8833.57万元，同比增长24.58%。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">f1f6e3bfdfe0</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:21:56 GMT</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_通信财经</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Don't miss Laser Focus World’s PhotonicsNXT 2026 virtual event!</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/resources/media-gallery/55411422/dont-miss-laser-focus-worlds-photonicsnxt-2026-virtual-event</link><description>PhotonicsNXT brings the optics, photonics, and quantum community together for a 2-day series of educational presentations covering a range of advances, innovations, and applications.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">7ca7da7e934c</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:21:56 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>长安启源Q06:13.59万起标配激光雷达+800V闪充,15万级家用SUV新王来了</title><link>https://weixin.sogou.com/link?url=dn9a_-gY295K0Rci_xozVXfdMkSQTLW6cwJThYulHEtVjXrGTiVgS7_-9fN-vB2ph3c_nUc7SgweJJ-hLdEhulqXa8Fplpd9fEicurW1qJ9a406RmjZT_hzo-HPkbP089DdbF8Ruml0yg6wGHykvfEVHhhnREOipS5BGXzvalQ_hVktR8TOMc-KSAUReloNtHE1HQs_WnnSXqSQMCutR0lA9p-bcVZ3p3A-1WS5xj6QQgl6kCbfDGS4Hu7MJF6-rUR-p4Tnbo_H1AfaFW2DefQ..&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;query=%E6%BF%80%E5%85%89%E9%9B%B7%E8%BE%BE&amp;amp